{"3513600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scarlet Idol", "steam_appid": 3513600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Important Notice: Regional Availability</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We sincerely apologize, but due to current technical and budget constraints, our servers <strong>only support China</strong>(including Hong Kong, Taiwan, and Macao)<strong> at this stage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are located <strong>outside of China</strong>, you will likely experience high latency or connection issues. Please <strong>consider your purchase carefully</strong>, as we cannot guarantee a stable co-op experience for you at this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your understanding.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plot Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned infant Qi Ning returns to their old home, intending to take back their foster brother Qi Yu, who has been abused by the villagers. However, neither of them ever manages to leave...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Design:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players will experience spatially separated environments. They must piece together clues each can obtain, solve puzzles in their respective spaces, or cooperate with each other to advance the game progress and uncover more truths of the story. Meanwhile, many puzzles and horror elements are related to Zhejiang's folk culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scene Design:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All ancient stage scenes in the game are based on field research of local ancient stages in Zhejiang. Combined with puzzle-solving gameplay, they integrate the architectural structure of Zhejiang's water town and the spatial imagery of &quot;Wan Nian Tai&quot; (the &quot;eternal stage,&quot; a classic form of traditional stages), adding extra depth and charm to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio Design:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's audio is rooted in traditional Taoist culture, aiming to deliver a fresh yet classic design that inherits time-honored traditions.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plot Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned infant Qi Ning returns to their old home, intending to take back their foster brother Qi Yu, who has been abused by the villagers. However, neither of them ever manages to leave...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Design:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players will experience spatially separated environments. They must piece together clues each can obtain, solve puzzles in their respective spaces, or cooperate with each other to advance the game progress and uncover more truths of the story. Meanwhile, many puzzles and horror elements are related to Zhejiang's folk culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scene Design:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All ancient stage scenes in the game are based on field research of local ancient stages in Zhejiang. Combined with puzzle-solving gameplay, they integrate the architectural structure of Zhejiang's water town and the spatial imagery of &quot;Wan Nian Tai&quot; (the &quot;eternal stage,&quot; a classic form of traditional stages), adding extra depth and charm to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio Design:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's audio is rooted in traditional Taoist culture, aiming to deliver a fresh yet classic design that inherits time-honored traditions.</p>", "short_description": "Scarlet Idol is a 3D Chinese folk horror puzzle game featuring a co-op two-player mode. The game integrates various folk cultural elements, including the funeral rituals of the Wu-Yue region, Ghost operas, Mulian operas, the duomin (outcast communities)", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513600/d7514e65be0c5d22eab262c4d674d7aadcd99cf5/header.jpg?t=1787543411", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513600/4c22681db6b48a30cb3844d61ad819c1ca81c42b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787543411", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513600/4c22681db6b48a30cb3844d61ad819c1ca81c42b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787543411", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 6GB / AMD Radeon RX Vega 56  使用“流畅”画质时，能以1080p/60 fps进行游戏。   <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 需要PC兼容的带麦克风头戴式耳机 / 独立麦克风</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  WIndows 10 / 11 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K / AMD Ryzen 7 5700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 8GB / AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT 使用“标准”画质时，能以1080p/60 fps进行游戏。 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><